; Program 5.87: Uniform random numbers by (5.69), mapped to [a, b]: X(n) = a + (b − a)·V(n)
; Source: Дьяконов, «Справочник по расчётам на микрокалькуляторах», 1985, p.139 (book61.pdf page 140)
; Input: a in Ra, b in Rb, V0 in R0. Output: each С/П gives the next X(n); V(n) in R0.
;
; Book example: a = 2, b = 3, V0 = 0,1234567 -> 2,5678979; 2,012222; 2,452214
; @reg Ra=2 Rb=3 R0=0.1234567
; @run
; @expect X=2.5678979
; @run
; @expect X=2.012222
; @run
; @expect X=2.452214
;
00: ИП0 3 7 × 1 + Пd КИПd ↔ ИПd
10: − П0 ИПb ИПa − × ИПa + С/П БП 00
